{"pageid": 742, "title": "Dan Brisby", "revid": 1925, "categories": ["Characters", "Humans", "Children", "Archer's Peak", "Characters (SIKTC comics)"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Dan Brisby</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/4/41/DanBrisby.png/revision/latest?cb=20241215164846\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"DanBrisby\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/4/41/DanBrisby.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241215164846\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/4/41/DanBrisby.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241215164846 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/4/41/DanBrisby.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20241215164846 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"DanBrisby\" width=\"270\" height=\"223\" data-image-key=\"DanBrisby.png\" data-image-name=\"DanBrisby.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Biographical Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Alive</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occupation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Occupation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Student</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Relationships</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"affiliation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Affiliation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"first_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">First Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_1\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 1\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #1</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Dan Brisby</b> is a young boy from <a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak, Wisconsin</a>. A known bully, he blamed <a href=\"/wiki/James\" title=\"James\">James</a> for the death of his friend <a href=\"/wiki/Robbie\" title=\"Robbie\">Robbie</a> during the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak incident (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX2luY2lkZW50P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Archer's Peak incident</span>.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<p>Upon spotting James at the memorial for the deceased children after the beginning of the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak incident (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX2luY2lkZW50P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Archer's Peak incident</span>, Dan confronted him, claiming that he had gruesomely murdered all of the victims, and murdered Robbie for not liking him back. James shouts at him to \"Shut the fuck up,\" causing him to be sent to the Principal's office.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC1&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC1-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Physical_appearance\">Physical appearance</span></h2>\n<p>James is a young Caucasian boy with blond hair.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Personality\">Personality</span></h2>\n<p>Dan is a known bully at <a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak</a> School, with even the faculty admitting that he needs comeuppance. He acts homophobic towards James, calling him a pervert.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC1&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC1-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_1\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 1\">Issue #1</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"0fbd8161c38d636aa1e8c87c1fe4fa2d\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:155px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"DanBrisby-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:153px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:DanBrisby.png\" title=\"DanBrisby.png (931 KB)\" style=\"height:153px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/4/41/DanBrisby.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20241215164846\" title=\"DanBrisby.png (931 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"153\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"DanBrisby.png\" data-image-key=\"DanBrisby.png\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"DanBrisby.png (931 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"153\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"DanBrisby.png\" data-image-key=\"DanBrisby.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/4/41/DanBrisby.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20241215164846\" /></a></div></div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<small><div style=\"width:auto; max-height:190px; overflow:auto; padding-left:0.5em; padding-right:0.5em; border-top-left-radius:0.5em; border-bottom-left-radius:0.5em\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-SIKTC1-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SIKTC1_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SIKTC1_1-1\">1.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">Tynion, James IV</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something is Killing the Children</a>,</i> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Angel_of_Archer%27s_Peak_(comic_arc)\" title=\"The Angel of Archer&#39;s Peak (comic arc)\">vol. #1</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_1\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 1\">issue no. 1</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>, 2019.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div></small></div>", "fetched_at": "2026-10-28T22:43:09+00:00"}